    "initialScanAbsoluteTravelShortfallLowerBoundRad": "max(0,target - recorded absolute yaw path). If signed progress is missing this lower bound proves a miss when it exceeds tolerance; it is not a signed residual measurement.",
    "coverageGroundTruth": "not_measured for every run; no independent truth registration/coverability scoring performed.",
    "evidenceLocation": "localEvidenceRoot paths identify local raw artifacts. This metrics file does not claim all raw images, database files or map binaries are tracked in Git or uploaded.",
    "sourceIdentity": "Each complete evidence manifest rechecked byte-for-byte; source-before equals source-after, canonical source-set digest checked, all frozen runtime source files and unchanged current acceptance harness checked against their recorded hashes. This is not hardware attestation.",
    "slamProvider": "Workflow map provider is planar-rgbd-icp-posegraph v1; ROS RTAB-Map/Nav2 is the online navigation sidecar. They must not be conflated.",
    "lastPublishedWaypointDistanceM": "Last provider-reported pre-dispatch waypoint distance and target, not distance from the final stopped pose. New in 004; prior records lack these fields and remain null. configuredMinStepM is internal Survey configuration, not a mapping.build business argument."
  },
